      en: "The Benaki Museum is a cultural landmark with collections from antiquity to modern times. It combines art, everyday objects, and historical stories into a broad view of Greece. Its different buildings make it highly varied for visitors. The museum is a strong SEO anchor for Athens, art, and Greek identity."
