      en: "Lavrio is a historic industrial site in Attica with strong links to mining and port activity. The town was long known for silver, minerals, and technical production. Today Lavrio combines industrial history, port traffic, and a coastal setting. It is a strong SEO topic for industrial heritage and Greek economic geography."
